  "content": "<span>In Defense of Nathan Cofnas</span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-featured-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  <img alt=\"Debatable Ideas column logo\" height=\"433\" src=\"https://www.insidehighered.com/sites/default/files/2025-07/Debatable-Issue.jpg\" width=\"651\" />\n\n</div>\n      \n<span><span>Sara Brady</span></span>\n\n<span><time datetime=\"2026-08-25T03:00:00-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, August 25, 2026 - 03:00 AM\">Tue, 08/25/2026 - 03:00 AM</time>\n</span>\n<p>We must not abandon academic freedom and punish anyone for being a harsh critic, even when there are tragic results.</p>\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-authors field--type-entity-reference field--label-inline clearfix\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Byline(s)</div>\n          <div class=\"field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\"><a href=\"https://www.insidehighered.com/node/96184\" hreflang=\"en\">John K. Wilson</a></div>\n              </div>\n      </div>",
